---
// Hassan, ses profils Malt, LinkedIn et X, et les avis clients Malt (verbatim)
import { LINKEDIN_URL, MALT_URL, X_URL, reviews } from '../../data/offer';

interface Props { mist?: boolean }
const { mist = true } = Astro.props;
---

<section class:list={['nl-section', { 'nl-mist': mist }]} id="formateur">
  <div class="nl-wrap">
    <div class="nl-trainer">
      <div class="nl-trainer-id">
        <div class="nl-avatar">
          <img src="/images/team/hassan-hero.webp" alt="" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="nl-kicker">Qui vous forme</p>
          <h2 class="nl-h2">Hassan Houaiss</h2>
          <p class="nl-trainer-role">Fondateur d’Alefia, formateur IA</p>
          <div class="nl-profiles">
            <a href={MALT_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Voir les avis sur Malt">
              <img src="/images/malt-logo.svg" alt="" width="58" height="20" />
            </a>
            <a href={LINKEDIN_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Hassan sur LinkedIn">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="24" height="24" rx="4" fill="#0a66c2"/><path fill="#fff" d="M6.94 9.5H4.5v9h2.44v-9ZM5.72 5.5a1.41 1.41 0 1 0 0 2.82 1.41 1.41 0 0 0 0-2.82ZM19.5 13.4c0-2.42-1.3-4.08-3.53-4.08-1.15 0-1.98.58-2.4 1.25V9.5h-2.35v9h2.44v-4.6c0-1.22.5-2.13 1.6-2.13 1.08 0 1.8.8 1.8 2.13v4.6h2.44v-5.1Z"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href={X_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Hassan sur X">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="24" height="24" rx="4" fill="#000"/><path fill="#fff" d="M13.2 10.9 17.9 5.5h-1.1l-4.1 4.7-3.3-4.7H5.6l4.9 7.1-4.9 5.7h1.1l4.3-5 3.4 5h3.8l-5-7.4Zm-1.5 1.8-.5-.7-4-5.7h1.7l3.2 4.6.5.7 4.2 6h-1.7l-3.4-4.9Z"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="nl-trainer-bio">
        <p>J’ai passé 10 ans en banque, chez BNP Paribas et au Crédit Mutuel.</p>
        <p>Aujourd’hui, je forme les équipes de TPE et PME à utiliser l’IA dans leur travail de tous les jours.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ul class="nl-reviews" aria-label="Avis clients Malt">
      {reviews.map((r) => (
        <li>
          <p>«&nbsp;{r.text}&nbsp;»</p>
          <span><strong>{r.author}, {r.company}</strong>, avis client</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
